<title>USA: United Cos Financial sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>United Cos Financial sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from United Cos Financial was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>United Cos Financial provides non-traditional consumer and mortgage loan products throughout the U.S. through five distribution channels.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNITED COS FINANCIAL</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.375 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/2005</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.403  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 8.478 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P BB-PLUS	  SPREAD 205 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
